Recommends: virtualbox
Description: VirtualBox VM USB Boot Addon
 A small Tkinter GUI that creates a raw-disk VMDK descriptor for a selected
 USB drive, allowing VirtualBox virtual machines to boot from USB.
 .
 Features:
  * Lists disk devices with removable (USB) disks pinned to the top
  * Graphical privilege escalation via pkexec (no terminal needed)
  * One-click VMDK creation with unique names
  * Dark themed, modern interface
